<HEAD>
  <format>deck</format>
  <page-setup>
    <card-dimensions>16x9</card-dimensions>
    <card-margins>
      <top-left type="text">Test Company</top-left>
      <top-center type="cardNumbers" start-index="1" start-number="1" />
      <top-right type="themeLogo" />
      <bottom-center type="text">Confidential - Mock Stream Test</bottom-center>
    </card-margins>
    <theme id="marine" />
  </page-setup>
</HEAD>

<section image-layout="blank">
  <div class="body">
    <h1>Development Process Optimization</h1>
    <p>Modern software development balances multiple priorities to deliver quality products efficiently.</p>
  </div>
</section>


